        "The other iron ore miners will instead procure renewable energy through bilateral agreements with third parties such as APA and the Yindjibarndi Energy Corporation (YEC). YEC is transparent about its planned generation scale, but BESS components are marked optional and their size is undisclosed<sup class=\"refMark\">2</sup>. APA's Newman Renewable Energy Hub is similarly slated to include battery storage of undisclosed size<sup class=\"refMark\">3</sup>.",
